{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "26d1413a-2c0a-8283-ba8e-942a33a5f777",
  "created_at": "2026-02-21T10:16:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:12:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:12:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, hello. Well, I know City Hall is closed on Saturday, that's why I'm calling this line, the storm number. Is this the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, this is the right one. We pick up here when City Hall's closed. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:12:34-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, um, I'm Peggy Sullivan, and I apologize ahead of time if I ask any silly questions, I'm eighty-some years old and I don't know how this all works. But the water is coming up my driveway and it's, well, it's the catch basin at the corner. It's all clogged with leaves, a solid mat of them, and the water has nowhere to go so it backs right into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's no good. Where are you, Peggy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:13:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One-oh-six Ayrault Street. Up on the Hill. The drain is right at the corner there, by my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One hundred six Ayrault. Got it. And this is with the nor'easter we've got going today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, the one that's hitting today. It started this morning and it's coming down hard, and um, the leaves never got cleaned out all fall. I've been looking at that drain since October."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Has the water gotten into the house or the garage, or is it just the driveway so far?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the driveway so far. But it's creeping, and I'm not going out there to look every ten minutes, I'm too old for that. Now, I called about this before, well, a while back, and they told me it was a state road. A state road! Ayrault Street! So nobody would do anything, and I was just sent off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:14:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm, okay. Who told you that, do you remember? Was it this office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:14:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't remember who, a young man I think. He said it was the state's and I should call them, and I didn't know who to call, so I just, well, nothing happened. And the leaves just sat there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's frustrating, I get it. I'm writing this up as a clogged catch basin at the corner by 106 Ayrault, leaves blocking it, water backing into the driveway. I'll flag that you were told before it was a state road, so whoever picks it up can check whose drain it actually is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:14:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's all I want, honestly. Could somebody please come and clean it out? It's been months. I shouldn't have to keep asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in the request for cleaning. I can't tell you the exact time, crews are stretched thin in a storm like this, and they'll go after the worst flooding and any roads that are impassable first. But it's going in the system today so it's on their list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:15:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, um, I suppose I understand that. But it keeps happening, you see. Every time it rains hard. And nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:15:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Is there a good number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-five. That's the house phone, I'm always here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:15:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-five. Perfect. And if the water starts coming toward the house, don't wait on us. Call back on this line and tell me, and I'll mark it urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:15:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Well, um, thank you, dear. I hope somebody really comes this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:16:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it noted, Peggy. Stay inside and stay warm. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-21T10:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
